{"id":"b9c2b3bb904b3813","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-representable-function.md","title":"Representable Function","display":"df-representable-function — Representable Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-representable-function","aliases":["88-df-representable-function"],"display":"df-representable-function — Representable Function","depends_on":["[[88-df-theory]]","[[88-df-representable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-representable-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-representable-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-representable-function — Representable Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"14e11c6d19d5648b\" href=\"?note=14e11c6d19d5648b\" title=\"88-df-representable\">88-df-representable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (candidate total number-theoretic function)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Graph}(f)\">\\(\\operatorname{Graph}(f)\\)</span> (graph relation of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_{T,\\mathcal R}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_{T,\\mathcal R}\\)</span> (relation representability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14e11c6d19d5648b\" href=\"?note=14e11c6d19d5648b\" title=\"88-df-representable\">88-df-representable</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RepFn}_{T,\\mathcal R}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{RepFn}_{T,\\mathcal R}(f)\\)</span> (function representability predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的输入元数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Graph}_k(f)\">\\(\\operatorname{Graph}_k(f)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(k+1)\">\\((k+1)\\)</span> 元数值关系。其元素 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\vec n,m)\">\\((\\vec n,m)\\)</span> 表示扁平元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n_1,\\ldots,n_k,m)\">\\((n_1,\\ldots,n_k,m)\\)</span>；右端 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_{T,\\mathcal R}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_{T,\\mathcal R}\\)</span> 使用元数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k+1\">\\(k+1\\)</span>，而非外层的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Graph}_k(f)\">\\(\\operatorname{Graph}_k(f)\\)</span> 在下式的已定型全函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 上使用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RepFn}_{T,\\mathcal{R}}(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\nf:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Rep}_{T,\\mathcal{R}}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Graph}_k(f)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RepFn}_{T,\\mathcal{R}}(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\nf:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Rep}_{T,\\mathcal{R}}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Graph}_k(f)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Graph}_k(f)\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\vec n,m)\\in\\mathbb{N}^{k+1}:f(\\vec n)=m\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Graph}_k(f)\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\vec n,m)\\in\\mathbb{N}^{k+1}:f(\\vec n)=m\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>函数可表示性是其图关系的可表示性；它不是“递归函数”的同义词</li>\n<li>下标<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>固定图的元数；函数的全定义域条件属于定义而非标题假设。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"def3025c6c81c740","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"14e11c6d19d5648b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-representable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"def3025c6c81c740","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (theory, see [[88-df-theory]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"14e11c6d19d5648b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rep}_{T,\\mathcal R}$ (relation representability predicate, see [[88-df-representable]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Graph}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rep}_{T,\\mathcal R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RepFn}_{T,\\mathcal R}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Graph}_k(f)","display":false},{"tex":"(k+1)","display":false},{"tex":"(\\vec n,m)","display":false},{"tex":"(n_1,\\ldots,n_k,m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rep}_{T,\\mathcal R}","display":false},{"tex":"k+1","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Graph}_k(f)","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RepFn}_{T,\\mathcal{R}}(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\nf:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Rep}_{T,\\mathcal{R}}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Graph}_k(f)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Graph}_k(f)\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\vec n,m)\\in\\mathbb{N}^{k+1}:f(\\vec n)=m\\}","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":1593,"backlinks":[{"id":"268c5641ccf6ec59","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2aa923dca170bacd","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f5c5e5f1b0bfe9f6","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RepFn}$ 的原定义仍是图关系逐数词可表示，见 [[88-df-representable-function]]；本引理另行提供对角化实际需要的逐输入唯一输出公式，不重定义 $\\mathrm{RepFn}$。"},{"id":"94218fd1ec5a1360","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RepFn}_{T,\\mathcal R}(f)$ (function-representability predicate, see [[88-df-representable-function]])"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.